# my_engine: P1 tune and P2 snap swept on a ringing hit, octave presses (notes 24 apart), every knob at 0 and 255.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.0
track snare
preset 128 0 0 0 255 255 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 8
sweep p2 0 255 0 8
note 0 F3 1 100
note 8 F1 1 100
note 10 F5 1 100
preset 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 16 C4 1 127
param p1 255 20
param p2 255 20
param attack 255 20
param decay 255 20
param sustain 255 20
param release 255 20
note 20 C4 1 127
expect sound 0 8
expect sound 20 22
expect idle 40
